# Card.getTriggers reads the current state alone: a meld card's front face
# does not carry its meld face's triggers. Titania, Voice of Gaea enters
# with a Forest in the graveyard; Titania, Gaea Incarnate's "When NICKNAME
# enters, return all land cards from your graveyard to the battlefield
# tapped" is printed on the meld face, so the Forest stays put.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
resolvestack
